sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Authenticate, authorize, then transfer directly
accDescr: Cognito authenticates a user, the API checks object access, and a presigned URL delegates a direct S3 download.
participant U as Client
participant C as Cognito
participant A as API Gateway + Lambda
participant D as DynamoDB metadata
participant S as Private S3 bucket
U->>C: Sign in
C-->>U: User token
U->>A: Request object with token
A->>A: Validate token
A->>D: Check object ownership or entitlement
D-->>A: Authorized object key
A-->>U: Short-lived presigned GET URL
U->>S: HTTPS GET using signed URL
S-->>U: Object bytes
